msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Well, first, we need a Kafka broker.\n"
"You can follow the https://kafka.apache.org/quickstart[Apache Kafka "
"quickstart], or use the following `docker-compose.yaml` file:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Copy the `docker-compose.yaml` file in your project, and from a terminal, "
