msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you have https://quarkus.io/guides/building-native-image[GraalVM "
"installed and configured correctly], you can package this application as a "
"native executable:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Then, execute your native executable with: `./target/getting-started-kafka-1."
"0.0-SNAPSHOT-runner`, and you get a Quarkus application using Kafka starting "
"in a few milliseconds and consuming a ridiculous amount of memory: less than "
