msgstr ""

msgid "Summary"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In less than 10 minutes, we have a new Quarkus application using Apache "
"Kafka.\n"
"If you want to go further, check the https://quarkus.io/guides/kafka[Kafka "
"guide]."
msgstr ""
